## Oxygen
component-oxygen = Oxygen
    .genitive = oxygen
component-oxygen-description-novice = The gas we breathe: about a fifth of the air. Without oxygen there is no fire.
component-oxygen-description-school = Oxygen supports burning — a glowing splint bursts into flame in pure oxygen. Liquid oxygen is pale blue and is attracted by a magnet.
component-oxygen-safety-school = Pure oxygen makes things burn violently: keep oil, grease and open flames away from it.
